Text Style Combination Test

Text styles can now be combined. This should be reflected in the appearance of
the text below, and the values of the style window property.

This text should appear bold (style property is 2).
This text should appear italic (style property is 4).
This text should appear bold and italic (style property is 6).
This text should appear reversed (style property is 1).
This text should appear fixed width (style property is 8).
This text should appear reversed and fixed width (style property is 9).

Press a key to continue...
